Sec. 1 (amending A.R.S. 13-3102, subsection A, paragraph 16): 16. Trafficking in weapons or explosives for financial gain in order to assist, promote or further the interests of a criminal street gang, a criminal syndicate or a racketeering enterprise{+; OR +}[-. -]
Sec. 1 (A.R.S. 13-3102, subsection A, paragraph 17): {+17. INSTIGATING ANOTHER PERSON TO COMMIT AN OFFENSE THAT IS LISTED IN PARAGRAPH 1 OR 8 OF THIS SUBSECTION AND THAT PERSON COMMITS THE OFFENSE.+}
Sec. 1 (A.R.S. 13-3102, subsection M, last sentence): Misconduct involving weapons under subsection A, paragraph 2 {+OR 17 +}of this section is a class 3 misdemeanor.
Sec. 1 (A.R.S. 13-3102, subsection N, paragraph 2): {+2. +}{+"INSTIGATING+}{+" MEANS ENCOURAGING OR DIRECTING ANOTHER PERSON TO COMMIT A CRIME OR TO ENGAGE IN AN ACT THAT IS LIKELY TO RESULT IN A CRIME.+}
